  "description": "`Smdn.Devices.Mcp2221A` is a .NET library for the **Microchip Technology MCP2221 and MCP2221A, a USB2.0 to I2C/UART Protocol Converter with GPIO**.\nThis library provides APIs that enable .NET applications to access the functions of the MCP2221/MCP2221A via the USB HID interface.\n\nNote: Although this package is marked with `IsAotCompatible=true`, some of the dependency libraries do not explicitly state their AOT compatibility or are not yet AOT-compatible.\nAs a result, warnings such as `IL3058` may be reported during AOT-enabled compilation.",
